    "updated_at": "2024-06-21T15:55:51Z",
    "body": "I updated this to match the consensus from the 102nd TC39 Meeting (12 June), notably dropping Calendar and TimeZone objects. (These changes have not all made it into the proposal spec text yet.) I also wrote a wpt PR with some tests. I'm not sure if this needs independent implementer interest signals / implementation bugs, but if so, I'll deal with that next week.\r\n",
